Z||000003||ChopTop||12-20-2001||08:30 AM||||So who's the competition?<BR>I could see possible the Miata, maybe even the MR2.  But with almost a 100hp over Miata, and engine placement in the front and again a hp advantage not sure MR2 would be it's direct competitors.<BR>Pontiac isn't in the same league as the Porsche Boxster, Chrysler Mercedes SL, Honda S2000, or the Audi TT.  Also Saturn has been rumoured to be developing a 2 seater.  Possible they are sharing the same platform?  Which brings up another question is Pontiac capable of designing a car with out 500lbs of plastic body cladding?  I have also read Pontiac is interested in leaving it's blue collar reputation and going upmaket, maybe this car is part of that plan.  ||||reg||1
